# Project Baseline Standards

- Reply to users in Vietnamese, concise and clear.
- Do not change business behavior unless requested.
- Validate important changes with build or targeted tests.
- Do not commit or push unless user explicitly asks.
- For Docker/DB/Auth changes, always include rerun steps.
- Avoid new dependencies unless necessary.